  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">(Not in Use) Support to African Risk Capacity (ARC) Agency to provide technical assistance to African Countries seeking to participate, or participating, in the ARC Risk Pool</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity (Not in Use) Support to African Risk Capacity (ARC) Agency to provide technical assistance to African Countries seeking to participate, or participating, in the ARC Risk Pool is a component of Risk Pools Programme (RPP) reported by FCDO with a funding type of 109 - Multilateral organisation and a budget of &#xa3;4,814,999. This project benefits Developing countries, unspecified. It works in the following sector(s): Disaster prevention and preparedness, Social Protection, Food assistance.</narrative>
  </description>
